<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">Dear <b>{!IndividualApplication.PI_Name__c}</b>,</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">Thank you for submitting your application titled "{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}" (Application ID: {!IndividualApplication.Name}).</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">We deeply appreciate the time, effort, and thoughtfulness you have invested in developing your proposal. After a thorough and careful review by our expert panel, we regret to inform you that your application has not been shortlisted for presentation before the Selection Committee at this stage.<br><br></font></p><p class="isSelectedEnd"><b>COE Comments:</b><br>{!IndividualApplication.COE_Comments__c}<br><br></p><p><b>WIN Admin Comments:</b><br>{!IndividualApplication.WIN_Approval_Comments__c}</p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">Please note that this decision is not a reflection of the merit of your work, but rather the outcome of a highly competitive review process. We encourage you to carefully review the feedback and comments shared by our expert reviewers. Should you wish to resubmit your proposal in a future round, we would be happy to consider a revised application that takes into account the observations raised during the review process.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">The Wadhwani Innovation Network remains committed to fostering innovation and supporting promising research, and we hope this experience serves as a valuable stepping stone in your journey. We look forward to your continued engagement and wish you every success in your future endeavors.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><b>Wadhwani Foundation</b></font></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>